    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠρεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take care of, attend to,</i> c. acc., <i><span class="en">
